;; fib.regex: Clojure's regular expressions over the subset of java.util.regex that ordinary programs use
;; (stdlib §4.9): `(:require [fib.regex :as re])` or `(:use fib.regex)`. A facade over its parts, as
;; `fib.string` is: charset (sets of scalars), ast and parse (the pattern text to a tree), prog (the tree
;; compiled), pike (the Pike VM) and dfa (the lazy DFA), api (Regex, Match and the functions).
(ns fib.regex (:export-from fib.regex.api))
